Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:53.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not a blue screen. It's just....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:53.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是蓝背景  那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe it was just really clear that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许那天万里晴空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I have to talk to my grandmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得跟我外婆谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:06.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Wait a minute, honey! - Phoebs. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:06.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等一下  亲爱的  -菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:13.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So anyway I'm trying to get my boss's ex-wife to sleep with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.42,0:05:13.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在设法骗我老板的前任老婆上床
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But when Phoebe has a problem, everyone's all ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比有问题时  大家都洗耳恭听
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:24.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Esther Livingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:24.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}埃丝特·利文斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.86,0:05:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:30.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Pooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.40,0:05:30.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:33.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Gram. What you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:33.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}外婆  你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:36.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just updating the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:36.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更新电话簿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:38.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gram?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:38.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}外婆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:42.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I see the pictures of my dad again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:42.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以再看一次我爸的照片吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:47.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:47.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just, you know, to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是突然想看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is the one of your father in a meadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你爸站在草地上的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And helping a little boy fly a kite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他帮一个小男孩放风筝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And here he is at a graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.52,0:06:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这一张是他参加毕业典礼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:08.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:08.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一张毕业照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是毕业照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this really my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他真的是我爸吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:19.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is it really your fa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.45,0:06:19.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他真的是你爸  
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:22.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, god. Well, of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:22.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐  当然是了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:26.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I smell smoke. Maybe because someone's pants are on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:26.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}气氛不对啊  我看有人在说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:32.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In all the years we've been grandmother and granddaughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:32.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从出生到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you've never lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从没对我撒过谎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:39.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, that's not your father. It's a picture of a guy in a frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:39.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  他不是你爸爸  他只是一个相框模特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:42.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:42.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was your mother's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:46.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是你妈的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:48.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She didn't want you to know your real father...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:48.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不想让你知道谁是你爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... because he hurt her so much when he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:50.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他的离开把你妈的心给伤透了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:52.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't want to go wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:52.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不想跟着骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But then she died and it was harder to argue with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是她死了  那样跟她争就更难了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not impossible, but harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是不可能  只是更难
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:05.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. So he's not a famous tree surgeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:05.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那他就不是一个有名的树医
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I guess he doesn't live in a hut in Burma where there's no phones?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他也不住在没有电话的缅甸茅屋里头
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last I heard, he was a pharmacist somewhere upstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听说他在纽约州某个地方当药剂师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:19.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:19.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那没有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would the villagers worship a pharmacist?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}村民们为什么要崇拜一个药剂师呢  
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, that's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正我所知道的就这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:36.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.01,0:07:36.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:39.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:39.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:44.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:44.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is the real him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:46.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是他本人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:55.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remember my father all dressed up in the red suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:55.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我记得我爸爸  他穿了一身火红的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the big black boots and the patent leather belt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}黑色的大靴子  还有漆皮皮带
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:01.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sneaking around downstairs. He didn't want us to see him...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:01.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在楼下鬼鬼崇崇的  他不想被任何人发现
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:03.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but he'd be drunk so he'd stumble, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:03.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是他醉得东倒西歪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}crash into something and wake everybody up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:05.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后撞东撞西  把大家都吵醒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That doesn't sound like a very merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来不像是个快乐的圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:11.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who said anything about Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:11.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁说起圣诞节了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:18.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyone hear from Phoebe yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:18.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有没有菲比的消息  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望她没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. I know exactly what she's going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  我清楚知道她的处境
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do you know exactly what she's going through?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:26.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么会清楚知道她的处境  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:27.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:27.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她告诉我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:32.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you got there, Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:32.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡  你买了什么  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:34.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just some stuff for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.07,0:08:34.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}派对要用的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:37.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you guys doing here?Aren't you guys supposed to be shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:37.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们还在这里干什么  你们不是该去买礼物了吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You didn't buy presents yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:39.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们礼物还没买好吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:41.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tomorrow's Christmas Eve! What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:41.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天就是平安夜了  你们要怎么办  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you have to be Claymation to say stuff like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是黏土动画里面的人才会那么说的吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:50.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, by the way Mon, I don't think the mailman liked your cookies. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:50.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  摩妮卡  我想邮差不喜欢你的饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here are the ornaments your mom sent. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你妈寄来的装饰品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:00.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe the mailman liked the cookies. We just didn't give him enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:00.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说不定他喜欢我的饼干  只是嫌少了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:03.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, pigeons learn faster than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:03.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}摩妮卡  鸽子的悟性都比你高
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:13.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:13.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:16.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I know what will make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:16.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我知道怎么样让你好过点了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about you make a list about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.54,0:09:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你也写张关于我的列表怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:23.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget it. Ross. I'm not gonna stand here....and make a list
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:23.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  算了吧  罗斯  我才不会列...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, you're whiny...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  你爱发牢骚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you are obsessive, you are insecure...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没完没了  疑神疑鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:30.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you're gutless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:30.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有胆量
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't ever just "seize the day."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从来不知道怎么"把握时机"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:35.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You liked me for a year and you didn't do anything about it.
