Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:27.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because, I mean, what if he's not this great-dad guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:27.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为如果他不够做父亲的资格呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:33.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if he's still the dirtbag who ran out on my mom and us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:33.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他还是那个抛妻弃女的浑球呢  
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:39.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.61,0:19:39.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've already lost a fake dad this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这个礼拜已经失去一个假爸爸了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think I'm ready to lose a real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不想再失去一个真的爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:53.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pheebs, that's okay. You took a big step today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.83,0:19:53.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲菲  没关系的  你已经跨出一大步了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:20:00.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Someday, when you're ready, you'll make it past the hedges.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:20:00.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哪天你准备好了  就会主动去认他了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And when you do, he'll be lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到那个时候  他认你这个女儿  会感到很幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:05.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:05.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:11.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry about your shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.79,0:20:11.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉害你们来不及购物了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's okay. We'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系  会有办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, listen Phoebs, I know you're not goin' in there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你不要进去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:22.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but do you think it'd be alright if I went in and used his bathroom? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:22.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我可不可以进去借用洗手间  
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:25.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's fine, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:25.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系  算了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:28.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cool, snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:28.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不错  下雪了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kind of like a blank canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像空白的画布
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:44.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ho-ho-ho-holy crap, is it hot in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.45,0:20:44.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的老天  这里好热
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:49.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really, hey, you mind if I turn the heat down?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:49.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}介意我把暖气关小吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:51.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could have used that kind of thinking earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:51.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们怎么都没想到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, Pheebs, how did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  结果怎么样  
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I couldn't go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Honey, I'm sorry. - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:20:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-亲爱的  好可惜  -你还好吗  
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, it's okay, because I know he's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好  没关系  因为我知道他在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:04.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So that's enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:04.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在这样就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, it's after midnight! Merry Christmas, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.51,0:21:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位  过十二点了  祝大家圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:10.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, right! Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:10.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}圣诞快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:14.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Monica, the knob was broken
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.05,0:21:14.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  把手坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:17.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so I just turned it off from underneath, I hope that's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.54,0:21:17.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我从下面关掉了  没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:32.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rach, these are for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.55,0:21:32.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  送你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:35.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wiper blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:35.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汽车雨刷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:37.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't even have a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:37.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我连车都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:42.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but with this new-car smell, you'll think you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:42.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  但加上这个芳香剂  你会以为你有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:46.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Pheebs, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:46.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Toilet-seat covers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马桶座套
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that what you were doing while I was getting gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:57.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们是趁我加油的时候买的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:00.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们真好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And for Ross...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至于罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:04.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... Mr. Sweet Tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.73,0:22:04.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甜食先生
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:10.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You got me a cola drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:10.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们送我一瓶可乐  
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And a lemon-lime!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有柠檬酸橙汁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:20.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this is too much! I feel like I should get you another sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.30,0:22:20.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}礼物太厚礼了  我该再送你们一件毛衣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And last, but not least....
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}压轴出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're ribbed for your pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}螺纹的让你更有快感
